# 智能充电桩后端 — JetBrains HTTP Client 脚本
# 先启动服务：.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload
# 流程：注册/登录拿 token → 站点 → 充电会话 → 订单。契约见 doc/后端设计文档.md

### 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### 注册（重复则改用下方登录）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "13800000001",
  "password": "***"
}

### 登录（成功后把响应 token 填入下方 {{token}} 使用，或手动替换）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "13800000001",
  "password": "***"
}

### 当前用户
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 附近电站列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 站点详情
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/stations/s1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 扫码解析（按桩编号查桩）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/piles/by-code/p000000002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 启动充电
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/charging/start
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pileId": "p000000002"
}

### 充电实时数据（轮询口径，一期服务端模拟）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/charging/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 结束充电（把上一步订单号填入 CO... 段）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/charging/替换为实际订单号/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 订单列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 订单详情
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders/替换为实际订单号
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
